    "change": "add-login-page",
    "proposal": "# Proposal\n\n## Why\n\nPeople can't sign in from the shop's front page. They have to find the account page first.\n\n## What Changes\n\n- A **login page** at `/login` with email and password.\n- A sign-in link in the header.\n- Wrong passwords show one message, without saying which field was wrong.\n\n## Impact\n\n- Depends on `add-users`.\n",
